#NOP The essence of Sylvan Elf is pulled like a magnet into the Soul Drinker.
#NOP A smokey wisp of soul essence trails from Wyvern to the Soul Drinker.
#NOP With a wicked slash, Soul Drinker siphons essence from Faerie Lizard.
#NOP Soul Drinker lashes at Faerie Lizard, capturing some of his essence.

#NOP You tighten your grip on Soul Drinker. As the small emeralds in the grip
#NOP dig into your hand, you feel the sword surge.
#NOP A strong tendril of soul essence formed from the bodies of your animal
#NOP enemies flows from the sword and slams into Wyvern.

#NOP The emeralds are dark and empty.
#NOP The emeralds glow and pulse faintly.
#NOP The emeralds glow and pulse mildly.
#NOP The emeralds glow and pulse slowly.
#NOP The emeralds glow and pulse normally.
#NOP The emeralds glow and pulse quickly.
#NOP The emeralds glow and pulse rapidly.
#NOP The emeralds glow and pulse brilliantly.

#NOP 10 charges takes the blade from empty to mildly.

#ACTION {^{The essence of .* is pulled|A smokey wisp of soul essence |With a wicked slash, |Soul Drinker lashes at }}
{
    #MATH {_equipment[souldrinker]} {$_equipment[souldrinker] + 1};
};

#ALIAS {handler_soul_drinker}
{
    #NOP %1;
    #IF {$_equipment[souldrinker] > 10 && "$opponent[data][undead]" != "1"}
    {
        #UNVAR {_equipment[souldrinker]};
        #SEND {!grip blade};
    };
};
event_register {e_combat_round} {$path[equipment]/The Soul Drinker Blade.tin} {handler_soul_drinker};